{"unit":8,"no":29,"title":"Resolutions and plans","blurb":"Unit 8","VOCAB":[["plan","","план / планировать","жоспар(лау)",""],["decide","","решить","шешу",""],["hope","","надеяться","үміттену",""],["save money","","копить деньги","ақша жинау",""],["spend less time","","проводить меньше времени","аз уақыт жұмсау",""],["move house","","переехать","көшу",""],["join a gym","","записаться в спортзал","жаттығу залына жазылу",""],["look for","","искать","іздеу",""],["take a course","","пройти курс","курсқа жазылу",""],["resolution","","новогоднее обещание","жаңа жылғы серт",""],["tonight","","сегодня вечером","бүгін кешке",""],["tomorrow","","завтра","ертең",""],["next year","","в следующем году","келесі жылы",""],["instead","","вместо этого","оның орнына",""]],"SLIDES":[["💰","I'm going to save money."]],"PICWORDS":["plan","decide","hope","save money","spend less time","move house","join a gym","look for","take a course","resolution","tonight","tomorrow","next year","instead"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"11_5":"A1_L29_11_5.mp3","11_13":"A1_L29_11_13.mp3","11_2":"A1_L29_11_2.mp3"},"SEGS":{"11_5":[3.58,null],"11_13":[3.67,null],"11_2":[3.43,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Resolutions and plans</h2>\n      <p>Talk about your plans and intentions for the future.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes, top to bottom.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>After each <b>Check answers</b>, read the note — that is your teacher.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Say your answers out loud.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>Check your answers after each task.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Warm-up\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Warm-up</div>\n      <h2>Warm-up</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Classic resolutions. Which do people around you always make?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap the popular ones.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"card\"><b>🏋️</b> &nbsp;join a gym</div><div class=\"card\"><b>💰</b> &nbsp;save money</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📱</b> &nbsp;spend less time on the phone</div><div class=\"card\"><b>📚</b> &nbsp;take a course</div><div class=\"card\"><b>🏠</b> &nbsp;move house</div><div class=\"card\"><b>✈️</b> &nbsp;travel more</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">These are your plan words for this lesson.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Tap 🔊 to listen. Turn on translations only if you need them.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Recall\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Recall</div>\n      <h2>Recall</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Complete each plan with the correct words.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s3SSt1\" data-only=\"self\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I want a new flat — I'm going to ___ house.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">move</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">join</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">save</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">No more taxis! I'm going to ___ money.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">spend</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">save</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">move</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I'm going to ___ a gym in January.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">join</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">look for</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">hope</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">She's going to ___ a Spanish course.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">take</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">decide</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">move</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">He's going to ___ a new job.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">hope</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">join</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">look for</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">No gym this year — we're going to travel ___.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">tonight</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">instead</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">move</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>move house · save money · join a gym · take a course · look for a job · instead.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Match each plan verb to its partner.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Tap a verb, then tap its partner.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\"><b>Verb</b> &rarr; <b>Partner</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s3GRt3\" data-only=\"group\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>save</b> <select data-answer=\"money\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>join</b> <select data-answer=\"a gym\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>take</b> <select data-answer=\"a course\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>move</b> <select data-answer=\"house\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>look for</b> <select data-answer=\"a new job\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>spend less</b> <select data-answer=\"time online\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Match each plan verb to its partner.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Tap a verb, then tap its partner.</p>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\"><b>Verb</b> &rarr; <b>Partner</b></p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s3OOt5\" data-only=\"solo\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\"><b>save</b> <select data-answer=\"money\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\"><b>join</b> <select data-answer=\"a gym\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\"><b>take</b> <select data-answer=\"a course\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\"><b>move</b> <select data-answer=\"house\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\"><b>look for</b> <select data-answer=\"a new job\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\"><b>spend less</b> <select data-answer=\"time online\"><option value=\"\">choose&hellip;</option><option value=\"money\">money</option><option value=\"a gym\">a gym</option><option value=\"a course\">a course</option><option value=\"house\">house</option><option value=\"a new job\">a new job</option><option value=\"time online\">time online</option></select></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">going to — plans and intentions.</div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('11_5',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 11.5 — three sentences</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 We're going to organize a party. 2 I'm not going to visit my family this weekend. 3 What are you going to do for Mandela Day?</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s4t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Sentence 1 —\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">We're going to organize a part.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">We're going to organize a party.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">We're going to organize an party.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">In sentence 2, which word is strong?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">not</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">to</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">tos</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>“to” almost disappears /tə/ — but <b>not</b> in negatives is loud and clear.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>“I<b>'m going to spend</b> less time at work.”</div><div>“He<b>'s going to move</b> to Italy next year.”</div><div>“We<b>'re not going to join</b> a gym this year.”</div><div>“<b>Are you going to visit</b> him?”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">Notice</div><p><span class=\"q\">Notice:</span> three parts every time: <b>be + going to + base verb</b>. Find them.</p></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:18px;overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"gtable\"><tbody><tr><th>Form</th><th>Example</th></tr><tr><td>Positive</td><td class=\"pos\">I<b>'m going to spend</b> less time at work. · He<b>'s going to move</b> to Italy.</td></tr><tr><td>Negative</td><td class=\"pos\">We<b>'re not going to join</b> a gym this year. · He <b>isn't going to eat</b> for 24 hours.</td></tr><tr><td>Question</td><td class=\"pos\"><b>Are you going to visit</b> him? · <b>What are you going to do</b>?</td></tr><tr><td>Short answer</td><td>Yes, I am. / No, we aren't.</td></tr><tr><td>Time words</td><td>tonight · tomorrow · next week / month / year · soon</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div>Use <b>going to</b> for plans you already decided: resolutions, intentions.</div><div>Build: am/is/are + going to + base verb.</div><div>Questions: put be first — Are you going to…? What are you going to do?</div><div>The Present Continuous (I'm meeting Anna tomorrow) also works for fixed plans — you know it from Lesson 18.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Practice\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Practice</div>\n      <h2>Practice</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 — Build the plan.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s5t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ going to save money this year.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">'s</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">'m</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">'ve</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ going to move to Italy.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">'re</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">'ve</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">'s</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">We ___ going to join a gym. (negative)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">aren't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">doesn't</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">___ you going to visit him?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Is</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">He's going to ___ for a new job.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">looks</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">look</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">'m</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">What ___ you going to do tonight?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">do</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>am/is/are + going to + base verb — and questions start with be: Are you going to…?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s5t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I going to call you tomorrow.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I go to call you tomorrow.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I'm going to call you tomorrow.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I going to call you tomorrow.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “She's going to moves next year.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">She's going to moving next year.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">She've going to moving next year.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">She's going to move next year.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Are you going visit your aunt?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Are you going visiting your aunt?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Are you going to visit your aunt?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Are you going visit your aunt?</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>I<b>'m</b> going to · going to <b>move</b> (base verb) · going <b>to</b> visit.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Right now I ___ dinner.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">'m going to cook</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">'m cooking right now</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">'m cooking</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Tomorrow I ___ dinner for ten people.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">'m going to cook</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">'m cooking right now</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">'m cooking</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">These days I'm working a lot, so next month I ___ a holiday.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">'m going to take</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">take</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">'m cooking</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>right now → -ing (happening) · tomorrow / next month → going to (a plan).</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Listen\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; Listen</div>\n      <h2>Listen</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Two friends talk about New Year's resolutions.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then choose the correct answers.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('11_13',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 11.13 — the resolutions</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">M: Do you have any New Year's Resolutions this year? W: Yeah, I'm going to spend less time at work. M: Really? Are you going to spend more time with your friends and family? W: Yes, I want to spend more time with my brother, because he's going to move next year. M: Is he going to look for a new apartment? W: Oh, I didn't tell you. He's going to move to Italy. M: Wow! Are you and Johan going to visit him? W: That's my other resolution. We're not going to join a gym this year, because it's too expensive. So we're going to save some money for a trip to Italy instead!</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">What is her first resolution?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">To spend less time at work</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">To join a gym</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">To move to Italy</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Where is her brother going to move?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">To Italy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">To a new apartment in town</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">To Greece</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Why aren't they going to join a gym?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">They hate sport.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">It've too expensive.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">It's too expensive.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">What are they going to do instead?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Buy a car</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Save money for an trip to Italy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Save money for a trip to Italy</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Less time at work · the brother — Italy · the gym is too expensive · so they're going to save for the trip.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('11_2',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 11.2 — the day without electricity</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 We aren't going to use any electricity or use the car tomorrow. I'm going to walk to work and my husband's going to work by bike. 2 Next Saturday, I'm going to organize a game of football for the kids around here. We're going to sell tickets and give all the money to charity. 3 I've got a neighbour and he's unemployed at the moment. I'm going to help him find work. We're going to improve his CV and spend the day sending emails to companies.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s6t6\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Tomorrow the first family isn't going to use…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">water</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">electricity or the car</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">phones</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The football game money is going…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">to the players</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">electricity or the car</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">to charity</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>No electricity, no car — walking and cycling. And all the ticket money goes to charity.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">Write your five plans for next year.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">Three positive, one negative, one with “instead”.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>I'm going to…</li><li>I'm not going to…</li><li>…, so I'm going to… instead</li><li>next year / next month / soon</li><li>I hope…</li><li>save money · take a course · spend less time</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">Interview your partner about next year.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Five questions. Then report the best plan to another pair.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>What are you going to do…?</li><li>Are you going to…?</li><li>I'm going to…</li><li>I'm not going to…</li><li>…instead</li><li>He's / She's going to…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">Interview your teacher about next year.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Five questions. Then report the best plan to your teacher.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>What are you going to do…?</li><li>Are you going to…?</li><li>I'm going to…</li><li>I'm not going to…</li><li>…instead</li><li>He's / She's going to…</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — ask five questions: “What are you going to do next year? Are you going to save money / take a course / travel? What are you NOT going to do?”</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — swap roles.</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — report to another pair with he/she: “She's going to move house — and she's not going to buy a car!”</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Step 1</b> — ask five questions: “What are you going to do next year? Are you going to save money / take a course / travel? What are you NOT going to do?”</div><div><b>Step 2</b> — swap roles.</div><div><b>Step 3</b> — report to your teacher with he/she: “She's going to move house — and she's not going to buy a car!”</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s8t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I'm ___ to start a blog next year.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"going\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She is going ___ learn to drive.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"to\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">___ you going to travel next year?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Are\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>be + going to + base verb \\u00b7 question: Are you going to\\u2026? \\u00b7 negative: isn't going to.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s8t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">I going to start a blog.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'm going to start a blog.|I am going to start a blog.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">She is going start yoga.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She is going to start yoga.|She's going to start yoga.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">They are going to studying English.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"They are going to study English.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>be + going to + base verb \\u00b7 question: Are you going to\\u2026? \\u00b7 negative: isn't going to.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l29s8t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Say the plan: I / learn to drive<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I'm going to learn to drive.|I am going to learn to drive.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: you / travel next year<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Are you going to travel next year?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: He is going to smoke.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"He isn't going to smoke.|He's not going to smoke.\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>be + going to + base verb \\u00b7 question: Are you going to\\u2026? \\u00b7 negative: isn't going to.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}